WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.410
A few days later, the king and queen left the castle.

2
00:00:05.411 --> 00:00:10.757
They were going to visit a king in a faraway land.

3
00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:15.493
Nana and the prince waved good-bye from the castle steps.

4
00:00:15.494 --> 00:00:22.316
"Nana, take care of my precious boy," the queen said.

5
00:00:22.317 --> 00:00:27.877
"Bring me presents!" the prince shouted as the carriage rolled away.

6
00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:35.970
Nana sighed. This was her chance to try a magic spell.

7
00:00:35.971 --> 00:00:38.541
But magic was serious.

8
00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:42.586
Fairies used it only when they had to.

9
00:00:42.587 --> 00:00:47.041
She decided to talk to the prince one last time.

10
00:00:47.042 --> 00:00:50.840
"Prince, one day you'll rule this kingdom.

11
00:00:50.841 --> 00:00:54.374
You must have a kind and generous heart.

12
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:58.658
Please show me that you can be kind."

13
00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:04.668
"Okay." The prince looked around.

14
00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:10.874
"I see some servant girls. I'll ask if they need anything."

15
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:13.334
He ran to the servants.

16
00:01:13.335 --> 00:01:18.957
"You're working so hard. Can I bring you a refreshment?"

17
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:23.249
The servant girls looked surprised.

18
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:28.236
"Why, um, certainly, Your Highness," one said.

19
00:01:28.237 --> 00:01:35.624
"Great! I'll get some fruit." The prince dashed into the castle.

20
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.582
He returned with a bowl of fruit.

21
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:45.035
Nana beamed. "He's learning!" she thought.

22
00:01:45.036 --> 00:01:49.749
"Maybe magic isn't needed after all!"

23
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:57.082
But then the prince laughed and threw the fruit at them. "Stop

24
00:01:57.083 --> 00:02:02.041
that!" Nana pulled the prince away. "I've

25
00:02:02.042 --> 00:02:05.145
tried to teach you to be kind. But

26
00:02:05.146 --> 00:02:12.939
your heart is as cold as stone. So, I must do what I must do." The

27
00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:19.934
prince laughed. "Like what?" "Like

28
00:02:19.935 --> 00:02:22.957
this!" Poof!

29
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:33.265
The prince turned into a statue of stone covered in gold. "You

30
00:02:33.266 --> 00:02:38.696
will stand frozen above the village, watching your people. Seeing

31
00:02:38.697 --> 00:02:44.332
their struggles will surely soften your heart." "Break

32
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:50.832
this spell now!" the statue cried. "Only

33
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:54.750
you can do that," Nana said. "Tell

34
00:02:54.751 --> 00:03:01.249
me when you know how to be kind." Days

35
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:10.416
passed. Nana waited, nervously watching the statue. "Surely

36
00:03:10.417 --> 00:03:15.499
the prince sees the people's troubles now," she thought. "And

37
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:20.124
surely he wants to help them." But

38
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:24.541
the statue stayed silent. ***

39
00:03:24.542 --> 00:03:28.319
Then one day news came.

40
00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.925
The king and queen were returning home.

41
00:03:31.926 --> 00:03:35.145
Nana ran to the statue.

42
00:03:35.146 --> 00:03:40.082
"I can't let them see my magic spell," she thought.

43
00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:43.824
She tried to break the spell herself.

44
00:03:43.825 --> 00:03:50.736
But nothing worked—the magic was too strong.

45
00:03:50.737 --> 00:03:54.576
Nana buried her face in her hands.

46
00:03:54.577 --> 00:04:00.957
"The king will throw me into the dungeon! I must leave at once!"

47
00:04:00.958 --> 00:04:12.833
Poof! Nana disappeared, leaving the statue all alone.

